          <h3>Verification Methodology</h3>
          <p>Cases are included only when they meet rigorous verification standards:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Court documents or legal filings</li>
            <li>Multiple independent news sources</li>
            <li>Official government acknowledgment</li>
            <li>Documented family testimony</li>
