          <p>This database documents cases where chatbot interaction was alleged or cited as a contributing factor. It makes no independent claims about causation, platform liability, or policy implications. Inclusion in this database reflects the existence of a documented claim—not a determination of responsibility. Given billions of chatbot interactions occur annually, cases involving alleged harm remain statistically rare.</p>
